Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Demo User"
}

### 3. Get without token (expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

### 4. Update with empty name (expect 400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}